---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Operations for Healthcare Practices and Founder-Led Companies"
  description="We take responsibility for the systems, technology, compliance, and processes your business runs on."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Operations for Healthcare Practices and Founder-Led Companies</h1>
      <p class="lead">We take responsibility for the systems, technology, compliance, and processes your business runs on.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a href="/booking" class="btn">Book a Discovery Call</a>
        <a href="/services" class="btn-outline">See What's Included</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>What We Manage</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="manage-grid">
        <div class="manage-item">Microsoft 365, Teams, and SharePoint setup, deployment, and access administration</div>
        <div class="manage-item">Financial proformas, forecasting, and decision-ready reporting</div>
        <div class="manage-item">Insurance administration — malpractice, liability, and payer enrollment</div>
        <div class="manage-item">Credentialing and hospital privileging across institutions</div>
        <div class="manage-item">Vendor and supplier management, domestic and international</div>
        <div class="manage-item">SOPs, onboarding systems, and process documentation</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Built for Ambiguity</h2>
        <p>Most operational problems don't come with a clear owner or a clear process. Servare Opus takes responsibility for them anyway — identifying what's missing, building the structure the situation requires, and carrying the work to resolution without needing to be managed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="actions" style="justify-content:center; display:flex;">
        <a href="/about" class="btn-outline" style="color:var(--ink) !important; border-color:var(--ink);">Learn How We Work</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
